"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1451120/extras/c09cc728fdd0a9e6a5bef008b287e09f.avif?t=1770404875\" width=600 height=224 /></span>",
      "short_description": "Traverse a harmonious hand painted forest in this first person hike. ☀️The trees guide you with gentle whispers, as you explore a philosophical story.",
